---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative bg-[#f9f9f9]">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-24 lg:py-[72px]">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="mt-0 text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-balance ">Increase Repeat Customers and Revenue</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 mt-10 -mx-4 gap-y-10 sm:mx-auto lg:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-14 lg:-mx-8">
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center lg:py-2">
              Gift Cards Issued
            </h3>
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/GC-issue.webp">
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg">Our commitment to data security is unwavering, and we take immense pride in being entrusted with customer data from around the globe.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
          <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center  lg:py-2">
              Customers Rewarded
            </h3>
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/reward.webp">
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg">Maintaining a high level of security not only requires advance protection measures, but great deal of accountability for all organizations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div   class="flex flex-col rounded-3xl p-[0.060rem] border border-gray-200">
        <div class="h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-center  lg:py-2">
              Orders Processed
            </h3>
            <div class="mt-6 text-indigo-400">
              <img class="" alt="Retain users with gift card software" loading="lazy" width="350" src="/assets/about-us/order-process.webp">
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg">Our legal and security teams consistently update certifications to ensure ongoing protection for customers on the LambdaTest platform.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



